{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "be773deb-be94-8d80-8398-174de0586174",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T15:49:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Elvis Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Elvis Varela. I have a question about, um, a banner. For my shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A banner. Okay. You want to hang it on the building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, on the front. Only for one week. I have a sale. I want to know how I get the approval for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so a banner counts as a sign, even a temporary one. You'd need to apply for a sign permit. Where's the shop located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The address is forty-nine Malbone Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Forty-nine Malbone. And are you the owner of the building or do you rent the space?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am the owner. Homeowner and the shop is, um, the same building. Sorry, you say it is a sign permit? Not a banner permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's the same permit. The city calls it a sign. Banner, sign, same application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sign. So, what documents I need to bring? I want to bring everything one time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. You'll want the completed sign application, a drawing or photo showing the banner and where it's going on the building, and the size. Width and height. And if you're not the owner, a letter from the owner. You are the owner, so that's easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The size, width and height. Yes. And the photo, it is of the building or of the banner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both is best. A photo of the front of the building, and a sketch or the artwork for the banner. Then mark on the photo where it hangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Please, can you say again the first one? The paper, the application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. One, the sign application. Two, the photo of the building with the spot marked. Three, the banner design with the size. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three things. Application, photo, design with size. Thank you. And the application, I get it where? Here at City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can pick it up here at the counter, or look on the city website under zoning. Either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, the website, I am not so good. I come to the counter. [pause] Sorry, one more thing. The sale is next week. Is it enough time? One week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, I'd come in tomorrow if you can. Review takes some time and I'd hate for it to land after your sale. Bring everything and we'll see where it stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. I am sorry, I am a little busy now. I am at the hardware store, they are cutting a key for my neighbor. He locked himself outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a favor. Okay, then. Counter's open until close of business tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. So tomorrow I bring the application, the photo, and the design with the size. And I do not hang the banner before the approval?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Wait for the approval first, then hang it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand more now. Not everything, but I come and you help me at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, ask for zoning and inspections. Anyone at the desk will point you over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Mister Greg. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T15:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
